{"Version":1,"StartNodeIndex":1,"Nodes":[{"Index":1,"DisplayName":"开始","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回公开阅读入口","NodeType":1,"SubType":6,"X":80,"Y":120,"Data":{},"Outputs":{"Next":[2]}},{"Index":2,"DisplayName":"章回转场","Comment":"按 VNNodeLibrary.txt 的 TransitionNode 序列化","NodeType":1,"SubType":4,"X":430,"Y":120,"Data":{"TransitionType":{"Kind":"Enum","StringValue":"FadeIn"},"BackgroundImage":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""},"Color":{"Kind":"Color","X":0,"Y":0,"Z":0,"W":1},"Duration":{"Kind":"Float","NumberValue":0.45}},"Outputs":{"Next":[10]}},{"Index":10,"DisplayName":"正文 001","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第1段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":800,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"Kind":"Object","ObjectValue":{"SpeakerId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"旁白"},"Text":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"再说陈宫临想要下手杀曹操，忽转念说：“我为国家跟他到此，杀了他不义，不如弃而他往。”插剑上马，不等天明，自投东郡去了。操觉，不见陈宫，思考：“这个人见我说了这两句，疑我不仁，弃我而去。我当急行，不可久留。”于是连夜到陈留，寻见父亲，备说前事，想要散家资招募义兵。父言：“资少，恐不成事。此间有孝廉卫兹，疏财仗义，他的家人巨富，若得相助，事可图了。”操摆酒张筵，拜请卫兹到家，告诉他说：“今汉朝皇室无主，董卓独揽权力，欺君害民，天下切齿。操想要力扶国家，恨力不足。公乃忠诚有义气之士，敢求相助！”卫兹说：“我有是心久矣，恨未遇英雄罢了。既孟德有大志，愿将家资相助。”操非常高兴。于是先发伪造诏令，驰报各道，然后招集义兵，竖起招兵白旗一边，上书“忠诚有义气”二字。没过几天间，应募之士，如雨骈集。"},"VoiceId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""}}}]}},"Outputs":{"Next":[11]}},{"Index":11,"DisplayName":"正文 002","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第2段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":1170,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"Kind":"Object","ObjectValue":{"SpeakerId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"旁白"},"Text":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"一日，有一个阳平卫国人，姓乐，名进，字文谦，前来投奔曹操。又有一个山阳巨野人，姓李，名典，字曼成，也前来投奔曹操。操都留为帐前吏。又有沛国谯人夏侯惇，字元让，乃夏侯婴之后。自小习枪棒，年十四，从师学武，有人辱骂其师，惇杀了他，逃于外方。得知曹操发兵，与其族弟夏侯渊两个各引壮士千人来会。此二人本操的弟弟兄。操父曹嵩，原是夏侯氏的儿子，过继与曹家，因此是同族。没过几天，曹氏兄弟曹仁、曹洪各率领军队千余来助。曹仁字子孝，曹洪字子廉，二人弓马熟娴，武艺精通。操非常高兴，于村中调练军马。卫兹尽出家财，准备衣甲旗幡。四方送粮食者，不计其数。"},"VoiceId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""}}}]}},"Outputs":{"Next":[12]}},{"Index":12,"DisplayName":"正文 003","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第3段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":1540,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"Kind":"Object","ObjectValue":{"SpeakerId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"旁白"},"Text":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"时袁绍得操伪造诏令，乃聚麾下文武，率领军队三万，离渤海来与曹操会盟。操作讨伐文告以达诸郡，讨伐文告说："},"VoiceId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""}}}]}},"Outputs":{"Next":[13]}},{"Index":13,"DisplayName":"正文 004","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第4段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":1910,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"Kind":"Object","ObjectValue":{"SpeakerId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"诗赞"},"Text":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"操等谨以大义布告天下：董卓欺天罔地，灭国弑君，秽乱宫禁，残害生灵，狠戾不仁，罪恶充积。今奉皇帝秘密诏令，大集义兵，誓想要扫清华夏，剿灭杀死群凶。望兴义师，共泄公愤，扶持皇室，拯救百姓。讨伐文告到日，可速奉行！"},"VoiceId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""}}}]}},"Outputs":{"Next":[14]}},{"Index":14,"DisplayName":"正文 005","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第5段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":2280,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"Kind":"Object","ObjectValue":{"SpeakerId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"旁白"},"Text":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"操发讨伐文告去后，各镇诸侯，都发兵相应："},"VoiceId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""}}}]}},"Outputs":{"Next":[15]}},{"Index":15,"DisplayName":"正文 006","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第6段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":2650,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"Kind":"Object","ObjectValue":{"SpeakerId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"诗赞"},"Text":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"第一镇，后将军南阳太守袁术。"},"VoiceId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""}}}]}},"Outputs":{"Next":[16]}},{"Index":16,"DisplayName":"正文 007","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第7段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":3020,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"Kind":"Object","ObjectValue":{"SpeakerId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"诗赞"},"Text":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"第二镇，冀州牧韩馥。"},"VoiceId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""}}}]}},"Outputs":{"Next":[17]}},{"Index":17,"DisplayName":"正文 008","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第8段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":3390,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"Kind":"Object","ObjectValue":{"SpeakerId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"诗赞"},"Text":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"第三镇，豫州刺史孔伷。"},"VoiceId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""}}}]}},"Outputs":{"Next":[18]}},{"Index":18,"DisplayName":"正文 009","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第9段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":3760,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"Kind":"Object","ObjectValue":{"SpeakerId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"诗赞"},"Text":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"第四镇，兖州刺史刘岱。"},"VoiceId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""}}}]}},"Outputs":{"Next":[19]}},{"Index":19,"DisplayName":"正文 010","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第10段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":4130,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"Kind":"Object","ObjectValue":{"SpeakerId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"诗赞"},"Text":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"第五镇，河内郡太守王匡。"},"VoiceId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""}}}]}},"Outputs":{"Next":[20]}},{"Index":20,"DisplayName":"正文 011","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第11段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":4500,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"Kind":"Object","ObjectValue":{"SpeakerId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"诗赞"},"Text":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"第六镇，陈留太守张邈。"},"VoiceId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""}}}]}},"Outputs":{"Next":[21]}},{"Index":21,"DisplayName":"正文 012","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第12段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":4870,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"Kind":"Object","ObjectValue":{"SpeakerId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"诗赞"},"Text":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"第七镇，东郡太守乔瑁。"},"VoiceId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""}}}]}},"Outputs":{"Next":[22]}},{"Index":22,"DisplayName":"正文 013","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第13段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":5240,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"Kind":"Object","ObjectValue":{"SpeakerId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"诗赞"},"Text":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":"第八镇，山阳太守袁遗。"},"VoiceId":{"Kind":"String","StringValue":""}}}]}},"Outputs":{"Next":[23]}},{"Index":23,"DisplayName":"正文 014","Comment":"《三国演义》第5回，第14段","NodeType":1,"SubType":2,"X":5610,"Y":120,"Data":{"Lines":{"Kind":"List","Items":[{"K